1
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:02,907
Cukup Penguji Feng saja.

2
00:00:03,649 --> 00:00:04,041
Yang ini,

3
00:00:04,547 --> 00:00:05,607
saya simpan.

4
00:00:05,670 --> 00:00:06,375
Anak muda,

5
00:00:06,534 --> 00:00:07,322
kau tenang sekali.

6
00:00:07,915 --> 00:00:09,272
Tuan,

7
00:00:09,339 --> 00:00:10,656
juga begitu.

8
00:00:10,719 --> 00:00:11,205
Daftarnya,

9
00:00:11,463 --> 00:00:12,387
sudah dikirim.

10
00:00:13,464 --> 00:00:15,081
Bisa diubah kembali atau tidak,

11
00:00:15,145 --> 00:00:16,841
besok kita tahu.

12
00:00:16,906 --> 00:00:17,970
Kau tidak menuntut keluarga Wei?

13
00:00:18,404 --> 00:00:18,878
Kalau menuntut sekarang,

14
00:00:19,230 --> 00:00:20,399
kita yang mati terseret.

15
00:00:20,873 --> 00:00:21,905
Kertas ini,

16
00:00:22,208 --> 00:00:23,501
disimpan sampai paling berharga.

17
00:00:23,997 --> 00:00:24,681
Tanpa keluar modal,

18
00:00:25,051 --> 00:00:26,350
bunga berbunga.

19
00:00:26,412 --> 00:00:27,423
Tapi,

20
00:00:27,760 --> 00:00:28,887
bunganya tiga puluh persen buatku.

21
00:00:30,559 --> 00:00:31,976
Poin suka Tang Xiaotang,

22
00:00:32,572 --> 00:00:34,668
lima puluh dua.

23
00:00:37,907 --> 00:00:38,766
Jenderal Muda,

24
00:00:39,199 --> 00:00:39,857
ada kabar.

25
00:00:40,690 --> 00:00:41,198
Katakan.

26
00:00:42,096 --> 00:00:44,385
Jenderal masih hidup,

27
00:00:44,788 --> 00:00:46,908
di tambang garam perbatasan utara.

28
00:00:49,077 --> 00:00:49,977
Siapa…?

29
00:00:50,034 --> 00:00:50,983
siapa yang lihat?

30
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:52,524
Kepala reguku dulu,

31
00:00:52,827 --> 00:00:54,179
melihat dengan mata sendiri.

32
00:00:54,493 --> 00:00:56,225
Tuan Muda Xu yang menyuruhku

33
00:00:56,293 --> 00:00:57,059
menanyakannya.

34
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:08,790
Tiga tahun,

35
00:01:09,627 --> 00:01:10,156
kukira dia…

36
00:01:11,027 --> 00:01:12,168
Kau tak bisa

37
00:01:12,233 --> 00:01:13,341
bilang sesuatu?

38
00:01:15,957 --> 00:01:18,058
…Manis.

39
00:01:21,508 --> 00:01:22,484
Poin suka Qin Shuang,

40
00:01:23,325 --> 00:01:25,338
lima puluh lima.

41
00:01:26,978 --> 00:01:28,222
Si marga Qin itu,

42
00:01:28,516 --> 00:01:30,992
putri Qin Lieshan.

43
00:01:31,065 --> 00:01:31,846
Kabarnya pasti?

44
00:01:32,909 --> 00:01:34,180
Saya dengar sendiri.

45
00:01:34,802 --> 00:01:35,071
Keluarga Wei

46
00:01:35,745 --> 00:01:36,864
mencatat jasamu.

47
00:01:36,926 --> 00:01:38,395
Gadis keluarga Qin itu,

48
00:01:38,458 --> 00:01:39,696
Tuan Muda pasti senang.
